WEBVTT

00:00:10.045 --> 00:00:13.685
At last.
The Master Emerald.

00:00:14.325 --> 00:00:15.325
Ultimate power.

00:00:15.665 --> 00:00:17.965
Soon order
will be restored.

00:00:18.465 --> 00:00:20.925
All because of what
we have done together.

00:00:21.825 --> 00:00:23.725
Such a lovely sentiment,
Knuckles.

00:00:24.545 --> 00:00:26.925
I think I feel
a single tear forming.

00:00:30.235 --> 00:00:31.235
Sadly...

00:00:31.235 --> 00:00:32.235
[crackling]

00:00:32.302 --> 00:00:33.975
...you're as useful
to me now

00:00:33.975 --> 00:00:36.834
as a backstage pass
to Limp Bizkit.

00:00:36.942 --> 00:00:39.554
[thudding]
[Sonic yelling]
Whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa!

00:00:39.662 --> 00:00:41.187
[Sonic yelling]

00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:45.177
[yelling continues]

00:00:45.285 --> 00:00:47.461
[metal clanking]
[Sonic grunting]

00:00:47.570 --> 00:00:49.746
[yells, grunts]

00:00:49.856 --> 00:00:51.597
[coughing]

00:00:51.706 --> 00:00:52.721
Nailed it.

00:00:52.830 --> 00:00:54.136
[gasps]

00:00:54.245 --> 00:00:57.465
This guy is always trying
to spoil a bad thing!

00:00:58.324 --> 00:00:59.945
Ah! You guys
are here, too?

00:01:00.345 --> 00:01:01.605
Took the long way, huh?

00:01:01.785 --> 00:01:03.585
Is everything a joke
to you?

00:01:03.845 --> 00:01:06.785
Why must you
constantly interfere
with my destiny?

00:01:07.125 --> 00:01:10.685
Because my destiny
is to protect my friends
and family.

00:01:10.985 --> 00:01:12.865
I think I just threw up
in my mouth.

00:01:13.605 --> 00:01:18.405
And if you want that emerald,
you're gonna have
to go through me.

00:01:19.219 --> 00:01:20.685
[gulps]

00:01:24.795 --> 00:01:25.795
Whoa!

00:01:30.251 --> 00:01:31.554
[both yelling]

00:01:32.548 --> 00:01:34.811
[both grunting]

00:01:40.845 --> 00:01:43.485
The Echidna's
taking no prisoners today!

00:01:44.565 --> 00:01:47.965
Sonic has heart,
but will he lose
the quill to live?

00:01:49.445 --> 00:01:53.005
I don't want to fight you,
but you're not giving me
much choice.

00:01:55.795 --> 00:01:59.560
[grunting]

00:01:59.694 --> 00:02:02.795
[grunts]
Too easy. Let's do this.

00:02:08.357 --> 00:02:09.748
Huh?

00:02:09.852 --> 00:02:11.069
[grunts]

00:02:19.553 --> 00:02:22.334
[both grunting]

00:02:26.993 --> 00:02:28.036
[yelling]

00:02:28.141 --> 00:02:29.740
[grunting]

00:02:29.845 --> 00:02:34.485
Why don't you stand still
and die with honor?

00:02:34.685 --> 00:02:35.685
Let me think about it.

00:02:35.985 --> 00:02:39.145
Okay, I thought about it
and I pass.

00:02:39.560 --> 00:02:41.318
[yelling]

00:02:48.845 --> 00:02:50.165
Hi there, beautiful.

00:02:51.525 --> 00:02:53.725
You're the real deal,
aren't you?

00:02:54.605 --> 00:02:57.305
[in Italian]
Where have you been all my life?

00:02:58.630 --> 00:03:01.569
[groaning]

00:03:01.694 --> 00:03:04.234
Say goodbye, hedgehog.

00:03:04.345 --> 00:03:05.950
[gasps]

00:03:07.855 --> 00:03:10.455
Knuckles, stop.
Robotnik's stealing the Emerald!

00:03:10.774 --> 00:03:13.314
What kind of fool
do you take me for?

00:03:13.394 --> 00:03:14.394
Just look.

00:03:17.051 --> 00:03:18.644
Mine.

00:03:19.784 --> 00:03:22.364
Wait! That wasn't the deal.

00:03:22.513 --> 00:03:24.599
[boulder thuds]

00:03:25.444 --> 00:03:27.884
Oh, you poor, naive creature.

00:03:28.525 --> 00:03:29.525
It's not your fault.

00:03:30.125 --> 00:03:33.105
A more advanced intellect
would have seen this move
coming a mile away.

00:03:33.725 --> 00:03:35.145
Or 1.6 kilometers.

00:03:35.724 --> 00:03:38.724
But I trusted you!
You were my friend!

00:03:38.825 --> 00:03:42.102
[cackling]

00:03:45.585 --> 00:03:48.225
I'm sorry.
That just hit me funny.

00:03:49.165 --> 00:03:51.425
Let this be
my final lesson to you,

00:03:51.985 --> 00:03:54.465
you dim-witted
celestial skin tag.

00:03:55.585 --> 00:03:56.425
Friends...

00:03:56.425 --> 00:04:00.305
are open, honest
and vulnerable with each other.

00:04:00.825 --> 00:04:03.505
Which means X squared
times the hypotenuse
of Y squared,

00:04:03.505 --> 00:04:05.318
divided by the absolute value
of friendship, equals...

00:04:05.318 --> 00:04:06.275
dookie!

00:04:06.275 --> 00:04:08.020
Oh, no.

00:04:13.932 --> 00:04:15.676
[Sonic, Knuckles scream]

00:04:17.845 --> 00:04:21.024
Chaos is power!

00:04:21.131 --> 00:04:23.357
[yelling]

00:04:40.124 --> 00:04:41.954
Let's get out of here!

00:04:42.062 --> 00:04:43.642
[gasps]

00:04:55.095 --> 00:04:56.095
Knuckles!

00:05:00.864 --> 00:05:03.064
Water again? Come on!

00:05:12.864 --> 00:05:14.596
[straining]

00:05:19.028 --> 00:05:20.414
[Sonic growls]

00:05:20.518 --> 00:05:22.596
[straining]

00:05:22.699 --> 00:05:24.951
Mmm?[grunts]

00:05:25.055 --> 00:05:26.925
[muffled exclaiming]
Mmm?

00:05:27.029 --> 00:05:28.830
Mmm. Mmm.

00:05:29.765 --> 00:05:31.081
Mmm?

00:05:34.751 --> 00:05:38.180
[muffled yelling]

00:05:39.150 --> 00:05:41.193
[Sonic grunting]

00:05:41.817 --> 00:05:44.969
[muffled grunting]

00:05:49.055 --> 00:05:50.995
[groaning]

00:05:59.168 --> 00:06:01.731
[coughing]

00:06:01.835 --> 00:06:02.974
You saved me.

00:06:03.435 --> 00:06:05.855
Don't talk to me.
I'm not in the mood.

00:06:06.165 --> 00:06:07.289
[grunts]

00:06:07.289 --> 00:06:11.248
How dare you attack me
in my hour of sorrow!

00:06:11.248 --> 00:06:12.248
[grunts]

00:06:12.254 --> 00:06:13.735
Why did you save me?

00:06:14.268 --> 00:06:15.268
[grunts]

00:06:15.394 --> 00:06:17.694
Because you saved me first,

00:06:17.895 --> 00:06:21.235
which clearly gave you
a tactical advantage
I do not understand.

00:06:21.674 --> 00:06:25.315
It wasn't a tactic.
I couldn't just let you die.

00:06:25.975 --> 00:06:26.975
Why?

00:06:27.094 --> 00:06:30.794
I've been trying
to destroy you
since the moment we met.

00:06:31.175 --> 00:06:34.495
Because being a hero
isn't about taking care
of yourself.

00:06:35.074 --> 00:06:37.814
It's about taking responsibility
for other people.

00:06:40.975 --> 00:06:43.715
Hmm. Wise words.
An ancient Earth proverb?

00:06:44.095 --> 00:06:46.215
No, sir, that's
a Wachowski family special.

00:06:46.755 --> 00:06:48.395
I got it from a guy
in a rowboat.

00:06:49.355 --> 00:06:50.735
Someone who means a lot to me.

00:06:50.841 --> 00:06:52.627
[biplane approaching]

00:06:52.734 --> 00:06:53.995
Wait a second.
What's that sound?

00:06:56.805 --> 00:07:00.264
Only Sonic the Hedgehog
needs rescuing this much.

00:07:00.384 --> 00:07:02.824
[laughs]
That sly little fox!

00:07:05.345 --> 00:07:07.965
Come on, Knucklehead.
We're not beat yet.

00:07:08.765 --> 00:07:11.385
On the mountain,
you told me
you'd lost everything.

00:07:11.985 --> 00:07:12.985
The way I did.

00:07:13.545 --> 00:07:16.085
But you seem
so hopeful and free.

00:07:17.085 --> 00:07:21.025
How did you move forward
despite failing again?

00:07:21.525 --> 00:07:25.025
And again. And again.
And again. And again.

00:07:25.045 --> 00:07:28.505
Okay, I didn't fail that much.
But I didn't do this all alone.

00:07:28.865 --> 00:07:31.065
I found a new family.
New friends.

00:07:31.425 --> 00:07:32.425
And you can too.

00:07:34.944 --> 00:07:37.144
You don't have to be
alone anymore.

